{"id":"ganancia","lemma":"ganancia","pos":"noun","rank":2902,"glosses":["profit, gain, earnings"],"ipa":"/ɡaˈnanθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ganancias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ganancia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Su pérdida supone nuestra ganancia.","en":"Their loss is our gain.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"loss"},{"g":"to suppose","l":"suponer"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null]},{"text":"Repartiremos las ganancias entre todos.","en":"We'll divide the profits among all of us.","words":[{"g":"to share, give out","l":"repartir"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"between"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"}]},{"text":"Una pequeña ganancia es mejor que una gran pérdida.","en":"A small gain is better than a great loss.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610749","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"small","l":"pequeño"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"better"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"loss"}]},{"text":"Las ganancias fueron muy altas.","en":"The profits were very high.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null,{"g":"tall","l":"alto"}]},{"text":"Era difícil vivir de sus exiguas ganancias.","en":"It was difficult to live on his meager earnings.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"difficult"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,null]}]}